  <h2 class="cag-h2">Keep Reading Before You Reserve a Breeding Pair</h2>
  <p>Three pages worth your time before you send a deposit anywhere — ours or anyone else's. The first sets expectations on what greys cost across the board, so a listing price stops being an abstract number and starts being comparable. The second is the one we wish every buyer read first, because the scam patterns in this species are consistent, repetitive and easy to spot once somebody names them out loud. The third covers our Congo singles, in case the pair turns out not to be the bird you needed. <a href="/african-grey-parrot-breeders-comparison/">Our breeder comparison page</a> is the fourth, if you want to see how documentation practices differ seller to seller before you commit to any of us.</p>

